hared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"0UJqTczta018RoktahC0jw","review_id":"40Lj12z3gw344_2lG7iegw","date":"2017-10-15T22:33:00","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9444396495819092,"text_excerpt":"I love this place! I went a while ago but just now got to writing this review. I went with my sis, and got two appetizers and one ramen and it was more than enough. The menu changes a lot I believe, so make sure you look out for limited items. I think it's like the same type of things, just a variety. We got wings, which were covered in a nuoc mam (fish sauce) sticky sauce, which was amazing (General Meow's wings). Then we got crab beignets, which had a really good vegetable topping. I asked for the sauce on the side because I don't like cheese. Then the ramen was so good. We got the pork tonkotsu to share. The broth was really rich, and the brussel sprouts were sooo good. I think next ti..."},{"business_id":"0UJqTczta018RoktahC0jw","review_id":"XOne0tGPyIzB4x2JVcMFoQ","date":"2017-12-01T14:57:01","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9388663172721863,"text_excerpt":"Came here after a couple drinks so this review may be offset towards the positive. That being said Kin is great. Definitely the best ramen I've had in New Orleans, and I'm glad that New Orleans is finally getting some good Ramen spots. I went with the classic Tonkotsu and the broth, as expected, was awesome, very flavorful and creamy. The brussels sprouts were a nice hipster touch to the otherwise traditional tonkotsu. They cooked really well. The enoki mushroom I also enjoyed, although it was a bit hard to eat. The place is small and quaint - the perfect place for a cold night when you crave ramen (since we get so many of those in New Orleans), and the service was nice. Also kudos to the..."},{"business_id":"0UJqTczta018RoktahC0jw","review_id":"a2p7G6-DhRx5HA7_NbHHhw","date":"2016-05-14T06:37:27","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9385807514190674,"text_excerpt":"I came in tonight around the usual dinner time for ramen because I heard it was really good and have always wanted to try it. I couldn't before because they didn't start serving ramen all day until recently. I had the Oxtail Ramen; two of my other friends got it as well and one ordered the Tonkotsu. We've tried many places such as Tiger's Den in Houston on Bellaire and this is by far the best we've ever had. The seating is also communal so the vibe was great. Service was great and always came and checked up on us. Will be coming back for more. If you've never had ramen before and or if you're visiting New Orleans, this is definitely the place to go to."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"0UJqTczta018RoktahC0jw","photo_id":"R3jzvBu7LryqfQiC7T0zjg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/R3jzvBu7LryqfQiC7T0zjg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9183042049407959},{"business_id":"0UJqTczta018RoktahC0jw","photo_id":"UGu2t503uqqShXb3R9mgBQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/UGu2t503uqqShXb3R9mgBQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8492927551269531},{"business_id":"0UJqTczta018RoktahC0jw","photo_id":"dYN84lEo1XuhBepkOJ6BQg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/dYN84lEo1XuhBepkOJ6BQg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8327149152755737},{"business_id":"0UJqTc